{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手薛凱琪日前現身《2026泉州草莓音樂節》舞台，她穿起吊帶連身短裙，外披西裝外套，下半身則搭配過膝長靴，雖以純黑色為主調，不過胸前的銀白色植物裝飾，卻又突破了神秘的暗黑，效果甚佳。</p><p>在這次演出中，她演唱了《蘇州河》、《奇洛李維斯回信》等名曲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.727576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_hash":"4cd6e140902b851cfcfa4108fbbf3dd24abbdb8cb6a44ac2c6805057ebfffdca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}